# Play test of Twin Horns (CIPlay twin_horns, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: up the west horn's ladders, across the
# rope bridge to the east horn, the chest by the screecher's nest. Points as in its recipe.
island Twin Horns
offset 0 0
expect animals Screecher 1
wait 3
kill Screecher
# The ladders' foot, up to the ledge, up to the top
at -10 -10.5 h=2
climb -10 -8.65 h=2
expect stand -10 -6.5 h=7 below=8
climb -10 -5.15 h=7
expect stand -10 0 h=12 below=13
# Across the bridge
walk -9 0 to -6 0 to 0 0 to 6 0 to 9 0 h=12.1 below=14
expect stand 0.7 0 h=10.9 below=12
open Chest on the east horn
